[21.205216, "o", "2. **Parse and Format Dates**: Convert the '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"' ISO 8601 timestamp into a date string in the format '\"'\"'YYYY-MM-DD'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205237, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.205277, "o", "3. **Extract and Rename Fields**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205297, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[21.205314, "o", "> "]
[21.205374, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'id'\"'\"' as '\"'\"'user_id'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.205408, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'username'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205432, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.205453, "o", "   - Extract '\"'\"'email'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205474, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[21.205495, "o", "> "]
[21.205525, "o", "   - Extract and format '\"'\"'last_login'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205547, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[21.205565, "o", "> "]
[21.205611, "o", "   - Extract the count of roles as '\"'\"'role_count'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205623, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.205769, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.205791, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.205953, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.206082, "o", "5. **Output Format**: The output must be a JSON array of objects formatted with indentation of 2 spaces.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[21.206361, "o", "6. **Save Command**: Save the exact jq command you execute to a file named '\"'\"'/app/cmd.sh'\"'\"'. This file should contain the complete jq command used to generate the output, including all options and arguments.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[21.206388, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
